{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】西藏那曲市7級地震，旅議會指暫未收到求助個案。</p>\n<p>旅遊業議會回覆本台查詢指，地震地區不屬於旅行團主要旅遊區，不過位置鄰近拉薩，相信自駕遊人 才有機會到達該區。至於目前還有多少旅行團滯留在當地，旅議會指未有確實數字，會適時更新。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.548559+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:16:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.866196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:18.687528+00:00","content_hash":"4c7a35acb337e36619552c2f345b6e527563f1018a823a1eacbde918c7c1e223","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.548559+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}